{"duration": 41.11, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 6.62, "text": "A year later, Starboard showed what he\ncould do alone. On the eighteenth of June"}, {"start": 6.62, "end": 16.2, "text": "2023, researchers watched him catch a\nyoung great white about 2.5 metres long."}, {"start": 16.2, "end": 22.38, "text": "He grabbed it by the side fin. Within\ntwo minutes he had torn it open and taken"}, {"start": 22.38, "end": 28.52, "text": "the liver. Port stayed about a\nhundred metres away the whole time."}, {"start": 29.22, "end": 36.42, "text": "A second dead great white, 3.5 metres\nlong, was found nearby that day. Great"}, {"start": 36.42, "end": 41.11, "text": "whites then kept away from that part\nof the bay for about four months."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.22, "text": "A"}, {"start": 0.22, "end": 0.5, "text": "year"}, {"start": 0.5, "end": 1.2, "text": "later,"}, {"start": 1.84, "end": 2.18, "text": "Starboard"}, {"start": 2.18, "end": 2.64, "text": "showed"}, {"start": 2.64, "end": 2.94, "text": "what"}, {"start": 2.94, "end": 3.12, "text": "he"}, {"start": 3.12, "end": 3.28, "text": "could"}, {"start": 3.28, "end": 3.6, "text": "do"}, {"start": 3.6, "end": 4.16, "text": "alone."}, {"start": 5.04, "end": 5.18, "text": "On"}, {"start": 5.18, "end": 5.32, "text": "the"}, {"start": 5.32, "end": 6.0, "text": "eighteenth"}, {"start": 6.0, "end": 6.14, "text": "of"}, {"start": 6.14, "end": 6.38, "text": "June"}, {"start": 6.62, "end": 7.68, "text": "2023,"}, {"start": 8.78, "end": 8.92, "text": "researchers"}, {"start": 8.92, "end": 9.56, "text": "watched"}, {"start": 9.56, "end": 9.88, "text": "him"}, {"start": 9.88, "end": 10.32, "text": "catch"}, {"start": 10.32, "end": 10.92, "text": "a"}, {"start": 10.92, "end": 11.34, "text": "young"}, {"start": 11.34, "end": 11.86, "text": "great"}, {"start": 11.86, "end": 12.34, "text": "white"}, {"start": 12.34, "end": 13.32, "text": "about"}, {"start": 13.32, "end": 14.56, "text": "2.5"}, {"start": 14.56, "end": 14.84